   1:Core/Src/SSD1306.c **** /**
   2:Core/Src/SSD1306.c ****  * @file    SSD1306.c
   3:Core/Src/SSD1306.c ****  * @brief   STM32 HAL C port of the SSD1306 OLED driver.
   4:Core/Src/SSD1306.c ****  * @author  Ported from Saurav Sajeev's Arduino C++ library.
   5:Core/Src/SSD1306.c ****  *
   6:Core/Src/SSD1306.c ****  * Changes from the original Arduino C++ version:
   7:Core/Src/SSD1306.c ****  *  - Arduino Wire  → HAL_I2C_Master_Transmit
   8:Core/Src/SSD1306.c ****  *  - Arduino String → const char*
   9:Core/Src/SSD1306.c ****  *  - PROGMEM / pgm_read_byte removed (STM32 reads flash directly)
  10:Core/Src/SSD1306.c ****  *  - delay() → HAL_Delay()
  11:Core/Src/SSD1306.c ****  *  - yield()  removed
  12:Core/Src/SSD1306.c ****  *  - C++ class OLED → C struct OLED_t + OLED_xxx() functions
  13:Core/Src/SSD1306.c ****  *  - new / delete removed (no dynamic allocation needed in .c driver)
  14:Core/Src/SSD1306.c ****  */
  15:Core/Src/SSD1306.c **** 
